/dist-*/

# Derived image trees.
#
# `v5w/` IS committed — it is what the app bundles, and committing it means a
# build needs neither sharp nor Python.
#
# `v5cut/` is the intermediate between the two: regenerate it from the originals
# with `python scripts/cutouts.py`, then `node scripts/build-images.js`.
assets/images/v5cut/
